    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dis ! Tu es Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse ?\nTu pourrais me rendre un service ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400690073002000210020005400750020006500730020004400720065007300730065007500100003110000FF02010072007300650020003F000A0054007500200070006F0075007200720061006900730020006D0065002000720065006E00640072006500200075006E002000730065007200760069006300650020003F001000020114013F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ces derniers temps, il se produit des choses\nvraiment bizarres là où j’habite.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On dirait des phénomènes paranormaux...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E0020006400690072006100690074002000640065007300200070006800E9006E006F006D00E8006E0065007300200070006100720061006E006F0072006D006100750078002E002E002E001000020114013F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On entend des haut-parleurs dans un appartement\nvide, les pannes de courant se multiplient...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et puis, il y a ces bruits inquiétants qui viennent\ndu toit...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200070007500690073002C00200069006C00200079002000610020006300650073002000620072007500690074007300200069006E00710075006900E900740061006E0074007300200071007500690020007600690065006E006E0065006E0074000A0064007500200074006F00690074002E002E002E001000020114013F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je sais que si je n’en trouve pas la cause, je ne\npourrai pas être sereine, mais j’ai trop peur...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourrais-tu aller voir ce qui se passe\nsur le toit à ma place, s’il te plaît ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
