      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, te voilà !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C00200074006500200076006F0069006C00E000200021001000020114013F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Malgré ma peur, je brûlais de connaître\nla source de ces étranges phénomènes...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais... ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100690073002E002E002E0020003F001000020114013F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Denne...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440065006E006E0065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les haut-parleurs, les coupures de courant...\nCes phénomènes sont tous liés à l’électricité...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était donc juste ce petit Dedenne sauvage\nqui nous jouait des tours ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dedenne...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 2496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500640065006E006E0065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, quel soulagement ! S’il avait été question de\nparanormal, j’aurais été obligée de déménager !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout de même, voler de l’électricité,\nc’est du sérieux. Que va-t-on faire de lui ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dede !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500640065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est décidé : nous allons trouver quelqu’un\nqui s’occupera de toi !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais si je te prends encore à voler de l’électricité,\ntu ne t’en tireras pas à si bon compte.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 170
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grâce à toi, je vais de nouveau pouvoir dormir\nsur mes deux oreilles. Merci pour tout !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
